WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.978 --> 00:00:14.481
groaned as Glen went on and on about being a hero in the woods.

2
00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:21.265
“Maybe Glen should do a magic act for the talent show,” she mumbled to Ezra.

3
00:00:21.285 --> 00:00:23.247
“Huh?” Ezra said.

4
00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:28.150
“He just turned himself into a superhero,” Ivy said.

5
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.072
“And he turned you into a beaver.”

6
00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:33.785
Ezra crossed his arms.

7
00:00:33.805 --> 00:00:37.327
“I never came close to eating tree bark!”

8
00:00:38.327 --> 00:00:39.408
“Try telling Mr.

9
00:00:39.528 --> 00:00:41.689
Superhero that,” Ivy said.

10
00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:44.771
“He's acting like he saved all of our lives.”

11
00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:46.792
She sighed.

12
00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:50.494
“I have to meet Clara and Willow now.

13
00:00:51.995 --> 00:00:52.595
See you later.”

14
00:00:56.077 --> 00:01:00.500
As Ivy headed for her cabin, she started thinking about her talent show problem again.

15
00:01:01.652 --> 00:01:04.333
“I don't care what Clara says,” she thought.

16
00:01:04.353 --> 00:01:07.234
“Why can't drawing be my act?

17
00:01:08.255 --> 00:01:12.917
I can draw really fast, and everybody loves to see zombies and vampires.

18
00:01:14.097 --> 00:01:16.058
Clara and Willow can do their own act.”

19
00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:25.161
“Ivy!” Clara burst out as Ivy entered the cabin.

20
00:01:25.181 --> 00:01:28.403
“We have the best idea ever!”

21
00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:32.285
“I've been thinking too, and—” Ivy began.

22
00:01:32.305 --> 00:01:36.368
“We're going to do a song with our own dance moves!”

23
00:01:36.788 --> 00:01:37.409
Willow said.

24
00:01:37.429 --> 00:01:39.671
“It'll be amazing!”

25
00:01:41.052 --> 00:01:43.174
Clara tossed a pile of clothes on her bunk.

26
00:01:43.194 --> 00:01:45.556
“I'm picking our costumes.

27
00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:47.898
We can dress like pop stars!”

28
00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:54.123
“I'm working on our dance moves,” Willow spun in a circle and snapped her fingers.

29
00:01:55.384 --> 00:01:56.265
Ivy tried again.

30
00:01:56.285 --> 00:02:03.401
“I, um, think I'm going to—” “You're the creative type,” Clara said.

31
00:02:03.421 --> 00:02:06.223
“You can write a song for us.”

32
00:02:06.243 --> 00:02:10.725
“But I like to draw,” Ivy said.

33
00:02:10.745 --> 00:02:12.746
“Not write songs.

34
00:02:13.707 --> 00:02:18.009
So why don't I—” “Just make sure the song is about love!”

35
00:02:18.309 --> 00:02:19.490
Clara said dreamily.

36
00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:23.092
“All the best pop songs are about love.”

37
00:02:23.112 --> 00:02:27.194
“Grr!” Ivy thought in frustration.

38
00:02:28.455 --> 00:02:30.616
Clara and Willow were not listening to her.

39
00:02:31.556 --> 00:02:32.597
Not at all.

40
00:02:34.418 --> 00:02:36.019
There was no way out of this now.

41
00:02:36.559 --> 00:02:40.761
Unless Suddenly she had a fabulous idea.

42
00:02:40.781 --> 00:02:46.044
“I'll write a song so creepy and weird, they'll hate it!”

43
00:02:46.684 --> 00:02:47.265
Ivy thought.

44
00:02:48.925 --> 00:02:50.026
She chuckled to herself.

45
00:02:50.046 --> 00:02:53.288
“They won't want me in their group anymore.

46
00:02:54.769 --> 00:02:57.990
Then I can do a drawing act—all by myself!”

47
00:02:59.391 --> 00:03:00.932
Ivy had written poems before.

48
00:03:02.632 --> 00:03:05.174
She figured writing songs wouldn't be very different.

49
00:03:06.275 --> 00:03:09.077
Humming to herself, she began to write down words.

50
00:03:10.639 --> 00:03:13.561
Willow moved around the cabin, trying out dance moves.

51
00:03:14.822 --> 00:03:16.864
Clara held up a pair of pink shorts.

52
00:03:17.944 --> 00:03:19.245
“What should we call our group?

53
00:03:20.326 --> 00:03:23.949
How about CGB for Cute Girls Band?”

54
00:03:23.969 --> 00:03:26.912
“I like that,” Willow said.

55
00:03:26.932 --> 00:03:29.654
“But what do you think of Thrice?

56
00:03:30.454 --> 00:03:32.116
Because there are three of us.

57
00:03:33.148 --> 00:03:35.489
Or maybe Ever for Camp Evergreen?”

58
00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:37.890
Clara looked at Ivy.

59
00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:40.492
“Which group name do you like best?”

60
00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:45.474
“Well.” Ivy did a quick drawing in her sketch pad.

61
00:03:45.494 --> 00:03:50.737
“How about we call ourselves Vampyre?”

62
00:03:52.518 --> 00:03:54.338
She showed the other girls her drawing.

63
00:03:54.358 --> 00:03:57.060
“We can wear makeup like this.”

64
00:03:58.528 --> 00:04:03.491
The picture showed them with scary white faces, dark eyes, and bright red lips.

65
00:04:04.972 --> 00:04:06.773
Her two cabinmates looked shocked.

66
00:04:06.793 --> 00:04:10.455
“Um okay,” Clara said.

67
00:04:10.475 --> 00:04:12.376
“Maybe that's an idea.

68
00:04:13.356 --> 00:04:14.397
How's the song coming?”

69
00:04:14.417 --> 00:04:17.379
“Great!” Ivy said.

70
00:04:17.399 --> 00:04:19.680
“What do you think of this?”

71
00:04:21.801 --> 00:04:24.082
I'm hiding in the dark.

72
00:04:24.963 --> 00:04:26.944
Your love scares me.

73
00:04:27.468 --> 00:04:28.908
How you dare me.

74
00:04:30.549 --> 00:04:33.030
You really stole my heart.

75
00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.870
Your love chills me.

76
00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:37.971
Yes, it thrills me.

77
00:04:39.311 --> 00:04:40.492
It hurts me.

78
00:04:43.572 --> 00:04:45.053
Owie, owie, ow!

79
00:04:45.253 --> 00:04:48.274
Owie, owie, ow!ㅤ Ivy looked up.

80
00:04:57.832 --> 00:04:59.895
Clara and Willow were completely still.

81
00:04:59.915 --> 00:05:04.501
“They're so horrified, they don't know what to say!”

82
00:05:05.042 --> 00:05:06.083
Ivy thought gleefully.

83
00:05:06.103 --> 00:05:08.827
“I knew this was a brilliant plan!”

84
00:05:10.028 --> 00:05:11.771
Then Clara let out a shout.

85
00:05:11.791 --> 00:05:13.173
“Wow, Ivy!

86
00:05:13.193 --> 00:05:15.335
That's the greatest song ever!”
